{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございまーす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46コンベンション2011\n皆さんいかがだったでしょうか〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本番前に、かなりんと♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/02/111202_091220.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなりんもふもふしてて気持ちよさそうだったから抱きついちゃったー(*´д｀*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！美彩はMusic Ability のメンバーとして 歌を歌わせて頂きました♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハイタッチの時とコメントで『赤いスイートピーよかったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/sign01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』って言ってくださ方がいて 嬉しいです(*^^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんなにたくさんの方の前で歌ったのは生まれて初めてでした。\n大きなステージで、しかも1人で..。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不安でいっぱいやったけど いくちゃんの素晴らしいピアノ伴奏〜♪と みなさんの声援のおかげで何とか無事歌うことができました(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういうチャンスを頂けたことに 本当に感謝します。\n暖かい声援、本当にありがとうございました(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また いつか、こういう機会があれば嬉しいなぁ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージから見る、サイリウム本当に綺麗でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハイタッチも、楽しかった〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お手紙やプレゼントまで(>_<)ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハイタッチなので 握手会のようにゆっくりはお話しできなかったけど みなさんから楽しかったって言ってもらえたのが凄く嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/crying.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のイベントを通して、自分も メンバーもそれぞれ 皆で反省すべき点 学んだ点 これからの課題がいっぱい見つかったと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/bearing.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援してくださるファンの方々、いつも支えてくださるスタッフの方々 乃木坂46を応援してくださるみなさんに感謝します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この気持ちを忘れることなく、乃木坂46全員でステップアップ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/sign01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"して次にみなさんとお会いする時にはもっと成長した私たちでいられるように また今日から頑張ります(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも応援よろしくお願いします(>_<)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46っ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/sign01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/sign01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気合い入れてくぞっ(･∀･)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/sign01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/sign01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/sign01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー本当に楽しかった(=´∀｀)♪♪\nまた早くみなさんに会いたいなーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お忙しい中会場に来てくださった方 ニコニコ動画を見てくださった方、本当にありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/happy01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし、今日は金曜日や！\n今日も１日 仕事に学校に、元気に頑張りましょう＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさもレッスン頑張るからね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月に入って、2011年もあと少し。\n毎日Happyに過ごせるように、笑顔で(=´∀｀)人(´∀｀=)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/02/111202_003826_ed.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ps.今日はレッスンが終わったら あるメンバーとデートに行くのです。にひひひひー 今から楽しみ。誰でしょう♪また更新するにょー！"}],"source":"archive"}